  "full_text": "I'm in the library and one of the goddamn freemason fucks is sitting on the pot. And they made me wait like fucking forever yesterday too on the fucking pot. The freemason fucks did like turn and just fuck with me and get me off the streets. But I'm going, no motherfucker, you're fucking dead and I'll not fucking tell you that. God's gonna beat your fucking nigger asses. Anyway, so this fucking freemason fuck's in here. I don't know what the fuck's he's masturbating, some shit in there. So anyway, I'm gonna use the acoustics here. Go ahead, I'm waiting for the... Alright, you're lining bro. In the days of my... I like the acoustics in here. This fucker's sitting on the pot forever. In the days of my youth, I was told what it means to be a man. Now I've reached that age, I try to do all those things the best I can. But no matter how I try to find my way into the same old jam. Good times, bad times, you know I've had my share. Woman left home for a brown-eyed man. Still don't seem to care. 16, fell in love, girl as sweet as could be. Only took a couple of days before she was rid of me. Swore that she would be all mine, love me till the end. But when I whispered in her ear, lost another friend. Uh-oh, good times, bad times. No, I've had my share. Woman left all for a brown-eyed man. Still don't seem to care.",
